# Hardware layer

Chỉ sửa sensor/polling trong `App/Hardware/`.

## Monitor mới

```csharp
public sealed class XxxMonitor : PollingMonitorBase
{
    protected override void Refresh()
    {
        var computer = HardwareMonitorHost.Computer;
        // SensorReader / WmiHelper — never new Computer()
    }
}
```

- `Start()`/`Stop()` dùng base → ref-count `HardwareMonitorHost`.
- Expose metrics qua properties; `RaiseUpdated()` qua base timer.

## Helpers

- `SensorReader` — LHM theo `HardwareType` / `SensorType`
- `WmiHelper` — WMI dùng chung, không duplicate query string
- `PollNow()` — khi UI cần refresh ngay (đã có trên base)

